      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "45295A139DA1350B",
      "text": "¿Qué tal, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\n¿Estás disfrutando del campamento?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_01",
      "hash64": "1D7149A78716880D",
      "text": "¡¿Profe?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_02",
      "hash64": "1D7146A7871682F4",
      "text": "¡¿Qué haces aquí?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "45295B139DA136BE",
      "text": "Je, je. ¡He venido a ver qué tal te va!\\nSoy tu tutor, al fin y al cabo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "45295C139DA13871",
      "text": "Este viaje me está sirviendo para estudiar in situ\\nlos Pokémon de Noroteo, y no veas qué de...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "45295D139DA13A24",
      "text": "¡Ay, perdona![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "45295E139DA13BD7",
      "text": "Me pongo a hablar de mi investigación y se me\\nolvida que quería hablar contigo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "45295F139DA13D8A",
      "text": "Para compensarte por mi despiste... ¡te invito a\\nun pícnic![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "452960139DA13F3D",
      "text": "Como sabía que esto podía suceder, le pedí\\nal director Clavel la mesa y todo lo necesario.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "452951139DA125C0",
      "text": "Prueba ese bocadillo. ¡Dale, dale![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "452952139DA12773",
      "text": "Me ha quedado un poco feo, pero te garantizo\\nque el sabor no te defraudará.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "452CDF139DA44CE1",
      "text": "Para alguien que no suele salir mucho de casa,\\nestos trabajos de campo resultan extenuantes.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "452CDE139DA44B2E",
      "text": "Y tú recorriendo el mundo en tu búsqueda del\\ntesoro... ¡Te mereces el mayor de mis respetos![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "452CDD139DA4497B",
      "text": "A todo esto, ¿habrá algo en la Cesta?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "452CDC139DA447C8",
      "text": "¡Ta-ta-tacháaan![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "452CE3139DA453AD",
      "text": "¡Había un Huevo Pokémon dentro de la Cesta![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "452CE2139DA451FA",
      "text": "Qué curioso esto de encontrar un Huevo pese a\\nque Gulpin es el único presente aquí.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_03",
      "hash64": "1D7147A7871684A7",
      "text": "¿A qué se deberá?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_04",
      "hash64": "1D7144A787167F8E",
      "text": "¿Lo has puesto tú?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "452CE1139DA45047",
      "text": "Je, je. En realidad este Huevo lo he traído yo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "452CE0139DA44E94",
      "text": "Je, je. ¿Tan obvio ha sido?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "452CD7139DA43F49",
      "text": "Es uno de esos Huevos Pokémon que aparecen\\ndurante un pícnic.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "452CD6139DA43D96",
      "text": "Los Huevos de los que no pueden hacerse cargo\\nlos Entrenadores se donan a la academia para\\r\\nque cuidemos nosotros de ellos.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "453065139DA7666A",
      "text": "Pero he pensado que sería ideal confiárselos\\na Entrenadores talentosos de otras regiones,\\r\\nde modo que me he traído unos cuantos.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "453066139DA7681D",
      "text": "Dicho lo cual... ¡este es para ti, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_system_01",
      "hash64": "4CE7DECB5A676AEA",
      "text": "¡Has recibido un Huevo Pokémon!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "453063139DA76304",
      "text": "Je, je, la verdad es que venir hasta Noroteo para\\nentregarte un Huevo suena un poco absurdo,\\r\\npero sé que contigo queda en buenas manos.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_23",
      "hash64": "453064139DA764B7",
      "text": "Por cierto, ¿has estado usando la aplicación\\nPokédex desde que llegaste?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_24",
      "hash64": "453061139DA75F9E",
      "text": "La Pokédex de Noroteo se irá completando a\\nmedida que captures Pokémon de la comarca.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_25",
      "hash64": "453062139DA76151",
      "text": "Yo de momento me quedaré por esta zona,\\ncontinuando mis trabajos de campo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_26",
      "hash64": "45305F139DA75C38",
      "text": "En cuanto completes la Pokédex de Noroteo,\\n¡ven a decírmelo sin falta![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
